{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，S01、S05这类短停留段里，Y的非定时感受仍偏密，第一眼扫过去不如X的短词利落。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"平\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y把每一步心理变化拆成短句，并用放大加亮直接标出转折核心，感受又跟在对应念头后面或到音乐走到那里才出现，所以更容易抓住“为什么会这样”以及这一念怎样接到下一念。X虽然短词更容易掠过，但左右来回对照时不少感受只像气氛标签，和具体心理节点的对应较松；Y的身体感、空间感、动作感更具体，也更能让十四段像同一条不断推进又回望的情绪线。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9e6a8b29-8ba2-497a-b231-9c374e8d8b2c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T025549919130Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:56:05.410721+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1549ff7d03822bcee93a758d0eb29433138f37e58bd3ea853d9da2a0cc9870d7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_